{
    "title": "Baby Photo Editor",
    "description": "Baby Photo Editor is the ultimate <b>photo editor</b> app for capturing and enhancing family memories - from <b>pregnancy</b> to <b>birthdays</b> and beyond. Our vast collection of <b>editing, filtering and creative features</b> makes Baby Photo Editor the ultimate choice for celebrating family moments, offering hundreds of <b>templates, frames and stickers</b> tailored to creating happy parenting memories. \r\n \r\nAt Baby Photo Editor, we\u2019re all about the content, which is why we\u2019re always adding new designs, stickers and frames for themes like Christmas, Halloween, Thanksgiving, winter, calendar months, toys, sports and food.  Or, for a more personal milestone like pregnancy\u2019s, birthdays, special moments or personal growth, we\u2019ve got loads of special filters, stickers, frames and templates to choose from. \r\n \r\nWhy Baby Photo Editor by Bebi?\r\n\u25ba Edit pictures with filters, backgrounds, captions and more \r\n\u25ba Create collages or use choose from 300+ frames \u2013 they\u2019re easy to create and add as a story or post\r\n\u25ba Choose from 1500+ stickers \u2013 from event, to seasonal stickers, toys and animals. \r\n\u25ba Caption editor - add text with colors and themed fonts to label your milestone\r\n\u25ba Store and save any of your pictures, collages or albums to your device\r\n\u25ba Social - share pics directly to Instagram or any other social platform\r\n\u25ba Easy to use and 100% Ad free .  \r\n \r\nBecome the artist in your family and celebrate life\u2019s special family moments, from editing photos with backgrounds and filters, to choosing from dozens of frames, tonnes of milestone templates and thousands of stickers. Its free to download and 100% ad free!\r\n \r\nFor life's special moments, there\u2019s Baby Photo Editor to celebrate it.",
    "descriptionHTML": "Baby Photo Editor is the ultimate <b>photo editor</b> app for capturing and enhancing family memories - from <b>pregnancy</b> to <b>birthdays</b> and beyond. Our vast collection of <b>editing, filtering and creative features</b> makes Baby Photo Editor the ultimate choice for celebrating family moments, offering hundreds of <b>templates, frames and stickers</b> tailored to creating happy parenting memories. <br> <br>At Baby Photo Editor, we\u2019re all about the content, which is why we\u2019re always adding new designs, stickers and frames for themes like Christmas, Halloween, Thanksgiving, winter, calendar months, toys, sports and food.  Or, for a more personal milestone like pregnancy\u2019s, birthdays, special moments or personal growth, we\u2019ve got loads of special filters, stickers, frames and templates to choose from. <br> <br>Why Baby Photo Editor by Bebi?<br>\u25ba Edit pictures with filters, backgrounds, captions and more <br>\u25ba Create collages or use choose from 300+ frames \u2013 they\u2019re easy to create and add as a story or post<br>\u25ba Choose from 1500+ stickers \u2013 from event, to seasonal stickers, toys and animals. <br>\u25ba Caption editor - add text with colors and themed fonts to label your milestone<br>\u25ba Store and save any of your pictures, collages or albums to your device<br>\u25ba Social - share pics directly to Instagram or any other social platform<br>\u25ba Easy to use and 100% Ad free .  <br> <br>Become the artist in your family and celebrate life\u2019s special family moments, from editing photos with backgrounds and filters, to choosing from dozens of frames, tonnes of milestone templates and thousands of stickers. Its free to download and 100% ad free!<br> <br>For life&#39;s special moments, there\u2019s Baby Photo Editor to celebrate it.",
